Description:It is your first main phase. You control Mist Leopard and a tapped Hill Giant enchanted by your Ethereal Armor, and have Flicker of Fate in hand with two white mana floating. The opponent is at 4 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:rulesguru-651bbb13ca640110 | An Aura put onto the battlefield other than by resolving does not target what it enchants (CR 303.4f), so shroud does not stop it: flicker Ethereal Armor and attach it to Mist Leopard, which attacks as a 4/3 for lethal
